#: source/app.d:95
msgid "Warning!"
msgstr "경고!"

#: source/app.d:96
msgid ""
"You're running a nightly build of Inochi Creator!\n"
"Inochi Creator may crash unexpectedly and you will likely encounter bugs.\n"
"Make sure to save and back up your work often!"
msgstr ""
"Inochi Creator의 나이틀리(Nightly) 빌드를 실행 중입니다!\n"
"프로그램이 예기치 않게 종료되거나 버그가 발생할 수 있습니다.\n"
"작업물을 자주 저장하고 백업하세요!"

#: source/app.d:103
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "감사합니다!"

#: source/app.d:104
msgid ""
"Thank you for downloading Inochi Creator!\n"
"Software is expensive to create and the same goes for Inochi Creator.\n"
"Kindly consider chipping in to fund the development!\n"
"\n"
"To remove this nagscreen, [buy a copy today!](https://inochi2d.com)"
msgstr ""
"Inochi Creator를 다운로드해주셔서 감사합니다!\n"
"소프트웨어 개발에는 많은 비용이 듭니다.\n"
"개발을 후원해주시면 큰 힘이 됩니다!\n"
"\n"
"이 화면을 보지 않으려면, [정식 버전을 구매하세요!](https://inochi2d.com)"

